· 类型</p><p>荐票</p></div></div><div class="obs" id="claim-lhb-df8bccae41666d69"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-observation">观察</span><span class="claim-source">标的 · 历史对照</span></div><div class="obs-watch"><p class="mut">标的 · 历史对照</p><p>A档国盛证券股份有限公司宁波桑田路证券营业部：n=44，收缩执1胜率55.5%、均涨1.58%；A档联储证券股份有限公司杭州环城北路证券营业部：n=11，收缩执1胜率57.1%、均涨1.73%（小样本）；净买占比5-10%历史n=709，观察胜率55.4%、均涨1.23%，跟随胜率47.8%、均涨0.59%；涨停上榜历史n=2086，观察胜率57.0%、均涨1.6%，跟随胜率47.4%、均涨0.37%</p></div></div><div class="obs" id="claim-lhb-90ad6a68e60c9b6a"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-observation">观察</span><span class="claim-source">标的 · 理由</span></div><div class="obs-watch"><p class="mut">标的 · 理由</p><p>股票级当日榜净买5.5527亿元（买入12.7941亿、卖出7.2414亿，净买占比6.500391265033%）；席位明细去重后A档双点共振，合计净买3.6141亿元；机构专用与深股通同向，双源判定一致（源2买侧8.8864亿，不替代源1）；同日涨停池，连板数1。近60日日K收盘66.24，距离近60日高点-29.68%，区间位置48.36%，非高位追涨型；仅作条件性轻仓观察，不追竞价高开。</p></div></div><div class="obs" id="claim-lhb-7767dc729ca2f833"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-observation">观察</span><span class="claim-source">标的 · 代码</span></div><div class="obs-watch"><p class="mut">标的 · 代码</p><p>002792</p></div></div><div class="obs" id="claim-lhb-e337ee4dd75d426c"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-observation">观察</span><span class="claim-source">标的 · 名称</span></div><div class="obs-watch"><p class="mut">标的 · 名称</p><p>通宇通讯</p></div></div><div class="obs" id="claim-lhb-831803ff4b6236d6"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-observation">观察</span><span class="claim-source">标的 · 类型</span></div><div class="obs-watch"><p class="mut">标的 · 类型</p><p>观察</p></div></div><div class="obs" id="claim-lhb-a8fe3ad37d954bb1"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-observation">观察</span><span class="claim-source">标的 · 历史对照</span></div><div class="obs-watch"><p class="mut">标的 · 历史对照</p><p>A档国盛证券股份有限公司杭州建设三路证券营业部：n=30，收缩执1胜率50.0%、均涨1.51%；净买占比5-10%历史n=709，观察胜率55.4%、均涨1.23%，跟随胜率47.8%、均涨0.59%；15-30%换手历史n=1263，观察胜率47.4%、均涨0.14%，跟随胜率45.4%、均涨-0.1%</p></div></div><div class="obs" id="claim-lhb-1b4b01611dcc8685"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-observation">观察</span><span class="claim-source">标的 · 理由</span></div><div class="obs-watch"><p class="mut">标的 · 理由</p><p>股票级当日榜净买1.1694亿元（买入3.8514亿、卖出2.682亿，换手20.3126%）；A档国盛杭州建设三路净买0.345亿元，B档含机构/深股通，双源判定一致（源21.6176亿）；同日涨停池，连板数1。近60日日K距离高点-14.76%、区间位置68.66%，单A档且换手偏高，列观察，不直接执行。</p></div></div><div class="obs" id="claim-lhb-eff56176f0e08e30"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-observation">观察</span><span class="claim-source">标的 · 代码</span></div><div class="obs-watch"><p class="mut">标的 · 代码</p><p><a href="#component-SEATCARD">回看本段权威组件中的原条目</a></p></div></div><div class="obs" id="claim-lhb-36852cfcee783615"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-observation">观察</span><span class="claim-source">标的 · 名称</span></div><div class="obs-watch"><p class="mut">标的 · 名称</p><p><a href="#component-SEATCARD">回看本段权威组件中的原条目</a></p></div></div><div class="obs" id="claim-lhb-61dbcf2c24e074d4"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-observation">观察</span><span class="claim-source">标的 · 类型</span></div><div class="obs-watch"><p class="mut">标的 · 类型</p><p>观察</p></div></div><div class="obs" id="claim-lhb-ec903e6ae3c9779b"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-observation">观察</span><span class="claim-source">标的 · 历史对照</span></div><div class="obs-watch"><p class="mut">标的 · 历史对照</p><p>S档国联民生证券股份有限公司宁波财神殿南路证券营业部：n=9，收缩执1胜率63.1%、均涨2.52%（小样本）；15-30%换手历史n=1263，观察胜率47.4%、均涨0.14%，跟随胜率45.4%、均涨-0.1%；净买占比5-10%历史n=709，观察胜率55.4%、均涨1.23%</p></div></div><div class="obs" id="claim-lhb-db2d99749c194a7a"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-observation">观察</span><span class="claim-source">标的 · 理由</span></div><div class="obs-watch"><p class="mut">标的 · 理由</p><p>股票级当日榜净买0.5052亿元，但源2买侧1.7089亿元相对源1明显放大，双源判定为打折；唯一S档席位净买0.3043亿元且n=9为小样本，另有B档通道；未在同日涨停池。近60日收盘距高点-4.75%、区间位置87.83%，位置偏高，禁止升级正式买入。</p></div></div><div class="" id="claim-lhb-3db25d2b63c8d43c"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><h3>席位路判断 · 20260921</h3></div><div class="card"><span id="claim-lhb-c138117b7ae9f159"></span></div><div class="" id="claim-lhb-3aeb33ef60053d08"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><p><b>B档：中性偏进攻，1只条件性轻仓荐票，2只观察。</b></p></div><div class="" id="claim-lhb-42e5880be5b27913"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><p>市场温度63.2（中性），涨停103、炸板25、跌停2、最高5板。股票级净买以当日榜行权威值为准，区间累计榜、转债和重复榜行剔除。</p></div><div class="" id="claim-lhb-35bbeb3c1ad53e93"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><p>独立判断：双源一致+两席A档使002080可条件性轻仓；S档仅2行且多数资金在B档/未匹配通道，禁止把全市场涨停扩散解读为无条件进攻。</p></div></section><section id="temperature"><h2>二 资金温度 · 日度统计(买侧席位明细)</h2><div id="component-FUNDTEMP"><!--FUNDTEMP--><h3>二 资金温度 · 日度统计(买侧席位明细)</h3><div class="hint">柱=当日出手席次(<span style="color:#2e6f5e">■机构</span> <span style="color:#7c5cbf">■量化</span> <span style="color:#c0392b">■游资=活跃(截至昨日累计上榜≥8次,数据驱动)∪知名名单</span>),虚线=买侧总金额(右轴);底部圆点=温度(红热≥67/黄温/蓝冷&lt;34,当日总额在截至当日近60日的分位,零后视镜)。滚动窗口只显示最近20个交易日,日期增加不影响展示。★库实证(清洗后,区分度15.9pp,倒U型):<b>温和放量日(34-66分位)跟买61.6%最好,过热(≥67)仅45.7%,冷48.7%居中</b>=有钱进但不拥挤才有肉。<b>今日温度:28分位(冷)</b></div><div class="card"><svg viewBox="0 0 940 300" style="width:100%;height:auto;font-family:inherit"><line x1="46" y1="266" x2="930" y2="266" stroke="#e8e2d4" stroke-width="1"></line><text x="40" y="270" text-anchor="end" font-size="10" fill="#8a8272">0</text><line x1="46" y1="204" x2="930" y2="204" stroke="#e8e2d4" stroke-width="1"></line><text x="40" y="208" text-anchor="end" font-size="10" fill="#8a8272">45</text><line x1="46" y1="142" x2="930" y2="142" stroke="#e8e2d4" stroke-width="1"></line><text x="40" y="146" text-anchor="